# BeHappy app (Expo) — public, non-secret settings only.
# Anything prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ is embedded in the app bundle that every user downloads.
# NEVER put API keys or payment secrets here. They belong in server/.env (see server/.env.example).

# URL of the BeHappy API server (server/). Defaults to http://localhost:8787 in development.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8787

# Phone notifications (chats and messages) need the EAS project id — public, not a secret.
# Run `npx eas init` once (Expo account), then put the printed id here. Without it,
# reminders and in-app notifications still work; only pushes to phones are off.
# EAS_PROJECT_ID=
